      "source": "Undated in the source; the show's own commentary places it after Autumn of Armageddon (\"President McKane announced a while ago, after Autumn of Armageddon that Crucyfix would return\") and stages it on Christmas Eve — placed in the same year as Autumn of Armageddon absent a document naming the exact year."
